      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine Fläche wählen, um das Bauteil von dort anzusehen"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择一个面，从该方向查看零件"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Escolha uma face para ver a peça a partir dela"
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "اختر وجهًا لعرض القطعة منه"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kies een vlak om het onderdeel van daaruit te bekijken"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code: claude mcp add support-fins -- node /full/path/to/support-fins-mcp.mjs (Deno: deno run -RWE in place of node). Other apps: add an MCP server that runs that same command. Then ask, e.g. \"fin bracket.stl tilted 35° on Y\"." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claude Code: claude mcp add support-fins -- node /voller/pfad/zu/support-fins-mcp.mjs (Deno: deno run -RWE statt node). Andere Apps: einen MCP-Server hinzufügen, der denselben Befehl ausführt. Dann fragen, z. B. „fin bracket.stl tilted 35° on Y“."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claude Code：claude mcp add support-fins -- node /完整/路径/到/support-fins-mcp.mjs（Deno：用 deno run -RWE 代替 node）。其他应用：添加一个运行同一条命令的 MCP 服务器。然后直接提出需求，例如「fin bracket.stl tilted 35° on Y」。"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claude Code: claude mcp add support-fins -- node /caminho/completo/para/support-fins-mcp.mjs (Deno: deno run -RWE no lugar de node). Outros aplicativos: adicione um servidor MCP que execute esse mesmo comando. Depois peça, por exemplo, \"fin bracket.stl tilted 35° on Y\"."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claude Code: claude mcp add support-fins -- node /full/path/to/support-fins-mcp.mjs (مع Deno: استخدم deno run -RWE بدلاً من node). التطبيقات الأخرى: أضف خادم MCP يشغّل الأمر نفسه. ثم اطلب مثلاً \"fin bracket.stl tilted 35° on Y\"."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claude Code: claude mcp add support-fins -- node /volledig/pad/naar/support-fins-mcp.mjs (Deno: gebruik deno run -RWE in plaats van node). Andere apps: voeg een MCP-server toe die dezelfde opdracht uitvoert. Vraag daarna bijvoorbeeld: \"fin bracket.stl tilted 35° on Y\"."
          }
        }
      }
    },
