          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interface material: no flat contacts here, so every support prints in one material" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kontaktmaterial: keine flachen Kontakte, daher werden alle Stützen in einem Material gedruckt"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接触层材料：此处没有平面接触，因此所有支撑都用同一种材料打印"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Material de interface: não há contatos planos aqui, então todo suporte imprime num material só"
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "مادة التلامس: لا توجد ملامسات مسطحة هنا، لذا تُطبع كل الدعامات بمادة واحدة"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Contactmateriaal: hier zijn geen vlakke contactpunten, dus alle steunen worden in één materiaal geprint"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It prints tall, though, the weaker direction, so check the Strength arrow if it bears a load." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Druckt jedoch hochkant (schwächere Schichtrichtung). Bei Belastung Kraftpfeil beachten."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不过这样是立着打印，层间方向更弱；如果零件要承重，请查看受力箭头。"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mas ela imprime em pé, a direção mais fraca; confira a Seta de resistência se a peça sofrer carga."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لكنها تُطبع بوضع قائم، وهو الاتجاه الأضعف، لذا راجع سهم القوة إن كانت ستتحمل حملاً."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Het wordt wel hoog geprint, in de zwakkere richting. Controleer bij belasting de krachtpijl."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Just the fins and pad, in the part's print position, so they line up if imported beside it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nur die Finnen und das Pad in Druckposition, passend zum daneben importierten Bauteil."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅导出鳍片和底板垫，位于零件的打印位置，便于与零件一起导入时对正。"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Só as aletas e a base, na posição de impressão da peça, para alinharem se forem importadas junto com ela."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "الزعانف والقاعدة تثبيت فقط، في موضع طباعة القطعة، لتتطابق معها إذا استُوردت بجانبها."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alleen de vinnen en het voetje, in de printpositie van het onderdeel, zodat ze goed uitgelijnd zijn wanneer je ze ernaast importeert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
