    "One brace stands up to %@mm before gripping the part — that much of it prints as a lone wall. Fine if it prints; rotate so that side reaches the plate if it wobbles.%lld" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%#@n@"
          },
          "substitutions" : {
            "n" : {
              "argNum" : 2,
              "formatSpecifier" : "lld",
              "variations" : {
                "plural" : {
                  "other" : {
                    "stringUnit" : {
                      "state" : "translated",
                      "value" : "有 %arg 道防晃撑在咬住零件之前要立到 %1$@ mm 高 —— 这一段会作为孤墙打印。打得起来就没问题；如果会晃动，请旋转到那一侧能落到热床上⁣%arg⁣"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%#@n@"
          },
          "substitutions" : {
            "n" : {
              "argNum" : 2,
              "formatSpecifier" : "lld",
              "variations" : {
                "plural" : {
                  "one" : {
                    "stringUnit" : {
                      "state" : "translated",
                      "value" : "Uma escora sobe até %1$@ mm antes de prender a peça — esse trecho imprime como parede solta. Tudo bem se imprimir; gire para esse lado chegar à mesa se balançar.⁣%arg⁣"
                    }
                  },
                  "other" : {
                    "stringUnit" : {
                      "state" : "translated",
                      "value" : "%arg escoras sobem até %1$@ mm antes de prender a peça — esse trecho imprime como parede solta. Tudo bem se imprimir; gire para esse lado chegar à mesa se balançar.⁣%arg⁣"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%#@n@"
          },
          "substitutions" : {
            "n" : {
              "argNum" : 2,
              "formatSpecifier" : "lld",
              "variations" : {
                "plural" : {
                  "one" : {
                    "stringUnit" : {
                      "state" : "translated",
                      "value" : "One brace stands up to %1$@mm before gripping the part — that much of it prints as a lone wall. Fine if it prints; rotate so that side reaches the plate if it wobbles.⁣%arg⁣"
                    }
                  },
                  "other" : {
                    "stringUnit" : {
                      "state" : "translated",
                      "value" : "%arg braces stand up to %1$@mm before gripping the part — that much of it prints as a lone wall. Fine if it prints; rotate so that side reaches the plate if it wobbles.⁣%arg⁣"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One part with every hard shape: ramps, a ball, a thin ledge, a flat table, a mushroom, a cave, sideways holes and an arch, supported in Full coverage. Snap every wall off and tell us which stuck or tore the part, and which undersides sagged. A few droopy layers on the ball and a rougher table near the spine are what we get too." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Komplexer Testkörper mit anspruchsvollen Formen (Schrägen, Halbkugel, dünne Kanten, Brücken und Bohrungen mit voller Stützenabdeckung). Nach dem Druck alle Wände entfernen und prüfen, wo Stützen zu fest hafteten oder Überhänge durchhängen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个囊括各种难打形状的零件：斜面、球体、薄沿、平面台、蘑菇头、内腔、侧向孔和拱形，按全覆盖方式加支撑。把每堵墙都折断，并告诉我们哪些粘死或撕伤了零件、哪些底面下垂。球体上有几层轻微下垂、台面靠近脊线处略粗糙，我们自己打出来也是这样。"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uma peça com todas as formas difíceis: rampas, uma bola, uma aba fina, uma mesa plana, um cogumelo, uma caverna, furos laterais e um arco, com suporte em Cobertura total. Destaque todas as paredes e conte para nós quais prenderam ou arrancaram a peça, e quais partes de baixo cederam. Algumas camadas caídas na bola e a mesa mais áspera perto do bloco central acontecem aqui também."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "قطعة واحدة تضم كل الأشكال الصعبة: منحدرات، وكرة، وحافة رقيقة، وطاولة مسطحة، وفطر، وكهف، وثقوب أفقية، وقوس، مدعومة بوضع التغطية الكاملة. اكسر كل جدار وأخبرنا أيها علق أو مزّق القطعة، وأي الأسطح السفلية ترهّلت. بعض الطبقات المترهلة على الكرة وطاولة أخشن قرب العمود الفقري أمر نحصل عليه نحن أيضاً."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eén onderdeel met allerlei lastige vormen: hellingen, een bol, een dunne rand, een vlak plateau, een paddenstoel, een grot, horizontale gaten en een boog, ondersteund met Volledige dekking. Breek alle wanden af en noteer welke vastzaten of het onderdeel beschadigden, en waar de onderkanten doorhingen. Enkele doorhangende lagen op de bol en een ruwer plateau bij de middenrib zijn bij ons ook te zien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One small spot may print a bit rough." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
