    "Plugins ▸ Install plugin, pick the .py and tick it. Process settings ▸ Advanced ▸ Others ▸ Slicing Pipeline Plugin ▸ Add plugin ▸ Support Fins. Slice; answer Yes to the first slice's permission prompts." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plugins ▸ Plugin installieren, .py-Datei auswählen und aktivieren. Druckeinstellungen ▸ Erweitert ▸ Sonstige ▸ Slicing-Pipeline-Plugin ▸ Plugin hinzufügen ▸ Support Fins. Slicen; Sicherheitsabfragen beim ersten Slicen mit Ja bestätigen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "插件 ▸ 安装插件，选择 .py 文件并勾选启用。打印设置 ▸ 高级 ▸ 其他 ▸ 切片流水线插件 ▸ 添加插件 ▸ Support Fins。执行切片；首次切片的权限询问请选择「是」。"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plugins ▸ Install plugin, escolha o .py e marque-o. Configurações de processo ▸ Avançado ▸ Outros ▸ Slicing Pipeline Plugin ▸ Add plugin ▸ Support Fins. Fatie; responda Sim aos pedidos de permissão do primeiro fatiamento."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plugins ▸ Install plugin، ثم اختر ملف .py وفعّله. Process settings ▸ Advanced ▸ Others ▸ Slicing Pipeline Plugin ▸ Add plugin ▸ Support Fins. قم بالتقطيع، ثم أجب بـ Yes على رسائل طلب الإذن عند أول عملية تقطيع."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plugins ▸ Plugin installeren, selecteer het .py-bestand en vink het aan. Procesinstellingen ▸ Geavanceerd ▸ Overige ▸ Slicing Pipeline Plugin ▸ Plugin toevoegen ▸ Support Fins. Slice het model; klik bij de eerste keer slicen op Ja bij de toestemmingsmeldingen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
