          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A malha mesclada não pôde ser compartilhada com a GPU."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تعذّرت مشاركة الشبكة المدمجة مع وحدة معالجة الرسومات."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Het samengevoegde raster kon niet met de GPU worden gedeeld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pins attach each wall to the part, as a resin print needs." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Stifte verbinden jede Wand mit dem Bauteil, wie es ein Harzdruck braucht."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "插针把每堵墙与零件相连，这正是树脂打印所需要的。"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os pinos ligam cada parede à peça, como uma impressão em resina precisa."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تربط الدبابيس كل جدار بالقطعة، كما تحتاج طباعة الراتنج."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De pinnen verbinden elke wand met het onderdeel, zoals een harsprint nodig heeft."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rotate rings around the part. Off hides them; Rotate 90°, Reset and Lay a face flat still turn the part." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Drehringe um das Bauteil. Aus blendet sie aus; 90° drehen, Zurücksetzen und Fläche flach auflegen drehen das Bauteil weiterhin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "零件周围的旋转环。关闭即隐藏；「旋转 90°」「重置」和「放平面」仍然可以转动零件。"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os anéis de rotação em volta da peça. Desligado os esconde; Girar 90°, Zerar e Apoiar uma face na mesa continuam girando a peça."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "حلقات التدوير المحيطة بالقطعة. عند إيقاف الخيار تُخفى الحلقات، لكن تظل أوامر «تدوير 90°» و«إعادة تعيين» و«وضع أحد الأوجه على سطح الطباعة» قادرة على تدوير القطعة."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De draairingen rond het onderdeel. Uit verbergt ze; Draaien 90°, Resetten en Een vlak plat leggen draaien het onderdeel nog steeds."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The settings saved in this file couldn't be read; defaults are used." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die in dieser Datei gespeicherten Einstellungen konnten nicht gelesen werden; es gelten die Standardwerte."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取此文件中保存的设置，将使用默认值。"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Não foi possível ler as configurações salvas neste arquivo; os padrões serão usados."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تعذّرت قراءة الإعدادات المحفوظة في هذا الملف؛ سيتم استخدام الإعدادات الافتراضية."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De in dit bestand opgeslagen instellingen konden niet worden gelezen; de standaardwaarden worden gebruikt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sway braces stand edge-on against the tall sides and are tied on by tines all the way up, so the top can’t drift or wobble as it prints." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "防晃撑侧向贴住高瘦零件的直立面，并沿全高用齿连接，打印时顶部不会漂移或晃动。"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As escoras laterais ficam de lado contra as faces altas, presas por dentes até o topo, para a parte de cima não sair do lugar nem balançar durante a impressão."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tines grab onto the part and bend away when you snap the supports off." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Haltezacken greifen ins Bauteil und biegen sich weg, wenn man die Stützen abbricht."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "齿会咬住零件，在折断支撑时随之弯开。"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os dentes prendem na peça e se dobram quando você destaca os suportes."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تتشبث أسنان التثبيت بالقطعة وتنثني مبتعدةً عنها عند فصل الدعامات بالكسر."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De tandjes grijpen in het onderdeel en buigen weg wanneer je de ondersteuningen afbreekt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tines grab onto the part and bend away when you snap the wall off." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "齿会咬住零件，折断墙时随之弯开。"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os dentes prendem na peça e se dobram quando você destaca a parede."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %lld prop sit under overhangs too shallow to grip, so those get no tines." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "这 %1$lld 根撑柱位于过于平缓而无法咬合的悬垂下方，因此它们不带齿。"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "A escora fica sob balanços rasos demais para prender, então ela não leva dentes."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "As %1$lld escoras ficam sob balanços rasos demais para prender, então elas não levam dentes."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
