    "Unzip into the Mod folder of FreeCAD's user data folder (Help ▸ About shows it) and restart. Toolbar ▸ Add Support Fins." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In den Mod-Ordner des FreeCAD-Benutzerverzeichnisses entpacken (Hilfe ▸ Über FreeCAD zeigt den Pfad) und neu starten. Werkzeugleiste ▸ Support Fins hinzufügen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "解压到 FreeCAD 用户数据目录下的 Mod 文件夹（帮助 ▸ 关于 中会显示路径）并重启。工具栏 ▸ 添加 Support Fins。"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Descompacte na pasta Mod dentro da pasta de dados do usuário do FreeCAD (Ajuda ▸ Sobre mostra onde fica) e reinicie. Barra de ferramentas ▸ Add Support Fins."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "فك الضغط داخل مجلد Mod في مجلد بيانات مستخدم FreeCAD (تعرضه Help ▸ About) ثم أعد التشغيل. Toolbar ▸ Add Support Fins."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pak het bestand uit in de map Mod van de gebruikersgegevensmap van FreeCAD (Help ▸ Over toont waar die staat) en start FreeCAD opnieuw. Werkbalk ▸ Support Fins toevoegen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unzip somewhere it can stay, right-click SupportFins\\install.bat ▸ Run as administrator, restart SolidWorks. In a part: Support Fins tab ▸ Support Fins." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An einen festen Ort entpacken, Rechtsklick auf SupportFins\\install.bat ▸ Als Administrator ausführen, SolidWorks neu starten. In einem Teil: Registerkarte Support Fins ▸ Support Fins."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "解压到一个可以长期保留的位置，右键 SupportFins\\install.bat ▸ 以管理员身份运行，重启 SolidWorks。在零件中：「Support Fins」选项卡 ▸ Support Fins。"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Descompacte num lugar permanente, clique com o botão direito em SupportFins\\install.bat ▸ Executar como administrador e reinicie o SolidWorks. Numa peça: aba Support Fins ▸ Support Fins."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "فك الضغط في مجلد دائم، ثم انقر بزر الفأرة الأيمن على SupportFins\\install.bat ▸ Run as administrator، وأعد تشغيل SolidWorks. داخل قطعة: علامة التبويب Support Fins ▸ Support Fins."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pak het bestand uit op een plek waar het kan blijven staan, klik met de rechtermuisknop op SupportFins\\install.bat ▸ Als administrator uitvoeren en start SolidWorks opnieuw. Open een onderdeel en kies: tabblad Support Fins ▸ Support Fins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unzip, copy com.printfins.support-fins into the lua folder beside PrusaSlicer.ini, restart. Menu Support Fins ▸ Add a Fin: set Slope Angle to the underside's angle, then move the fin so its slope sits 0.2 mm under the part. Size it with Fin Height, not the scale tool: scaling stretches the one-layer tines." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Entpacken, com.printfins.support-fins in den lua-Ordner neben PrusaSlicer.ini kopieren, neu starten. Menü Support Fins ▸ Finne hinzufügen: Neigungswinkel anpassen und Finne 0.2 mm unter das Bauteil schieben. Größe über Finnenhöhe anpassen, nicht über das Skalierwerkzeug."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "解压，把 com.printfins.support-fins 复制到 PrusaSlicer.ini 旁边的 lua 文件夹，重启。菜单 Support Fins ▸ 添加鳍片：把 Slope Angle 设为底面的角度，再移动鳍片使其斜面位于零件下方 0.2 mm 处。用 Fin Height 调整大小，不要用缩放工具：缩放会把只有一层高的齿拉长。"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Descompacte, copie com.printfins.support-fins para a pasta lua ao lado do PrusaSlicer.ini e reinicie. Menu Support Fins ▸ Add a Fin: ajuste Slope Angle para o ângulo da parte de baixo e mova a aleta até a rampa ficar 0,2 mm abaixo da peça. Dimensione com Fin Height, não com a ferramenta de escala: escalar estica os dentes de uma camada."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "فك الضغط، وانسخ com.printfins.support-fins إلى مجلد lua المجاور لـ PrusaSlicer.ini، ثم أعد التشغيل. القائمة Support Fins ▸ Add a Fin: اضبط Slope Angle على زاوية السطح السفلي، ثم حرّك الزعنفة بحيث يقع منحدرها على بعد 0.2 mm تحت القطعة. اضبط حجمها عبر Fin Height وليس بأداة التحجيم: فالتحجيم يمطّ الأسنان ذات الطبقة الواحدة."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pak het bestand uit, kopieer com.printfins.support-fins naar de lua-map naast PrusaSlicer.ini en start PrusaSlicer opnieuw. Menu Support Fins ▸ Vin toevoegen: stel Slope Angle in op de hoek van de onderkant en verplaats de vin totdat de schuine zijde 0.2 mm onder het onderdeel zit. Pas de grootte aan met Fin Height, niet met het schaalgereedschap: schalen rekt de tandjes van één laag uit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unzip. Utilities ▸ Add-Ins ▸ Scripts and Add-Ins ▸ + ▸ pick the folder, Run (tick Run on Startup). Solid ▸ Create ▸ Insert Support Fins." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Entpacken. Dienstprogramme ▸ Zusatzmodule ▸ Skripte und Zusatzmodule ▸ + ▸ Ordner wählen, Ausführen (beim Start ausführen anhaken). Volumenkörper ▸ Erstellen ▸ Support Fins einfügen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "解压。实用工具 ▸ 加载项 ▸ 脚本和加载项 ▸ + ▸ 选择该文件夹，运行（勾选「启动时运行」）。实体 ▸ 创建 ▸ 插入 Support Fins。"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Descompacte. Utilities ▸ Add-Ins ▸ Scripts and Add-Ins ▸ + ▸ escolha a pasta, Run (marque Run on Startup). Solid ▸ Create ▸ Insert Support Fins."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "فك الضغط. Utilities ▸ Add-Ins ▸ Scripts and Add-Ins ▸ + ▸ اختر المجلد، ثم Run (فعّل Run on Startup). Solid ▸ Create ▸ Insert Support Fins."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pak het bestand uit. Hulpmiddelen ▸ Add-ins ▸ Scripts en add-ins ▸ + ▸ selecteer de map en klik op Uitvoeren (vink Bij opstarten uitvoeren aan). Solid ▸ Maken ▸ Support Fins invoegen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use This Size" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
