            "value" : "de verticale zijden worden in deze positie geblokkeerd door andere delen van het model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the workable spots would put the fin inside the part — try rotating" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可行的位置都会把鳍片放到零件内部 —— 请试着旋转"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "os pontos possíveis poriam a aleta dentro da peça — tente girar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "there is no face under that spot to brace" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "那个位置下方没有可支撑的面"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "não há face sob esse ponto para escorar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "this overhang sits above another part of the model, so a wall standing on the plate can’t reach it — rotate so it faces the plate" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此悬垂位于模型其他部分的上方，立在热床上的墙无法到达它 —— 请旋转到它朝向热床"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "este balanço fica acima de outra parte do modelo, então uma parede apoiada na mesa não o alcança — gire para ele ficar de frente para a mesa"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "this part balances on one point with nothing under it. Turn the bed pad on, or rotate until it sits down" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个零件靠一个点平衡，下方没有任何支撑。请开启底板垫，或旋转到它能落稳为止"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "esta peça se equilibra num ponto sem nada embaixo. Ligue a base na mesa, ou gire até ela assentar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "this part balances on one point, so the bed pad is holding it. Print with the pad on" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个零件靠一个点保持平衡，因此是底板垫在托住它。请保持开启底板垫再打印"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "esta peça se equilibra num ponto, então é a base na mesa que a segura. Imprima com a base ligada"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "this part balances on one point. Turn the bed pad on to seat it, or rotate until it sits down" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个零件靠一个点保持平衡。请开启底板垫来固定它，或旋转到它能落稳为止"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "esta peça se equilibra num ponto. Ligue a base na mesa para firmá-la, ou gire até ela assentar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "this part meets the plate on a small foot (%@ of first-layer edge), too little for a Light pad to grip, so Auto made it Sure hold, touching the part to hold it" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个零件以小脚接触热床（首层边缘仅 %1$@），「轻粘」底板垫无从咬合，因此「自动」改用了「牢固定位」，贴住零件来固定它"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "esta peça toca a mesa num pé pequeno (%1$@ de borda na primeira camada), pouco para uma base Leve prender, então o Automático usou Fixação firme, encostando na peça para segurá-la"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "this part meets the plate on a small foot (%@ of first-layer edge); a Light pad has almost nothing to grip. Auto or Sure hold holds it" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个零件以小脚接触热床（首层边缘仅 %1$@）；「轻粘」底板垫几乎无处咬合。「自动」或「牢固定位」才能固定它"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "esta peça toca a mesa num pé pequeno (%1$@ de borda na primeira camada); uma base Leve quase não tem onde prender. Automático ou Fixação firme seguram"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "this part meets the plate on a small foot (%@ of first-layer edge); a pad with a gap has almost nothing to grip. Sure hold, or Pad gap 0, holds it" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个零件以小脚接触热床（首层边缘仅 %1$@）；留间隙的底板垫几乎无处咬合。「牢固定位」，或把「底板垫间隙」设为 0，才能固定它"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "esta peça toca a mesa num pé pequeno (%1$@ de borda na primeira camada); uma base com folga quase não tem onde prender. Fixação firme, ou Folga da base 0, seguram"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "this part touches the plate at a single point, so it has nothing to stand on. Turn the bed pad on to seat it, or rotate until it sits down on a face or an edge" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses Bauteil berührt die Druckplatte nur an einem einzelnen Punkt und hat daher keinen Stand. Aktivieren Sie den Stützfuß, um es zu stützen, oder drehen Sie es, bis es auf einer Fläche oder Kante aufliegt."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个零件只以一个点与热床接触，因此没有可站立的面。请开启底板垫来固定它，或旋转到某个面或棱落在热床上"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "esta peça toca a mesa num único ponto, então não tem onde se apoiar. Ligue a base na mesa para firmá-la, ou gire até ela assentar numa face ou numa aresta"
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تلامس هذه القطعة سطح الطباعة عند نقطة واحدة فقط، فلا تجد ما تستند إليه. فعّل قاعدة التثبيت لإرسائها، أو دوّرها حتى تستقر على أحد أوجهها أو على حافة"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dit onderdeel raakt het printbed slechts op één punt en heeft daardoor geen stabiele basis. Schakel het steunvoetje in om het neer te zetten, of draai het totdat het op een vlak of rand rust."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tick Show midair starts in Settings › Display to see them" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "marque Mostrar inícios no ar em Configurações › Exibição para vê-los"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "times and filament from %@; yours will differ" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Druckzeit und Materialverbrauch geschätzt mit %1$@; tatsächliche Werte hängen von Ihrem Drucker ab."
